<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HALLE, Germany 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the</p>
<p>$875,000 German grass-court men's tennis tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 4-Boris Becker (Germany) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
</text>
